<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Néhémie</para>
  <para style="toc1">NÉHÉMIE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Néhémie</para>
  <para style="toc3">Né</para>
  <para style="mt1">NÉHÉMIE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1"/>Pawòl a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:1">Né 10:1</ref></char></note> Néhémie yo, fis Hacalia a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Alò, sa te fèt nan mwa Kisleu a, nan ventyèm ane a, pandan mwen te nan kapital <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 1:2">Est 1:2</ref></char></note>Suse la, <verse eid="NEH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2"/>ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:2">Né 7:2</ref> </char></note> Hanani, youn nan frè mwen yo, e kèk nan mesye ki soti Juda yo te vini. Mwen te mande yo sou Jwif yo ki te chape, e ki te reziste malgre kaptivite a, epi sou Jérusalem. <verse eid="NEH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3"/>Yo te di mwen: “Retay ki la nan pwovens lan, ki te chape e ki te reziste malgre kaptivite a nan gwo pwoblèm ak dezolasyon. Miray Jérusalem nan kraze nèt e pòtay li yo fin brile ak dife.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4"/>Lè m te tande pawòl sila yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:3">Esd 9:3</ref></char></note> mwen te chita la, mwen te kriye e fè gwo plent pandan kèk jou; epi mwen t ap fè jèn avèk lapriyè devan Bondye syèl la. <verse eid="NEH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5"/>Mwen te di: “Mwen sipliye W, O SENYÈ syèl la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:14">Né 4:14</ref></char></note> Bondye ki gran e mèvèye a, ki gade akò Li avèk lanmou dous Li pou sila ki renmen Li yo e ki kenbe kòmandman Li yo, <verse eid="NEH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6"/>ke zòrèy W kapab atantif e zye Ou yo louvri pou tande lapriyè sèvitè Ou a ke mwen ap fè devan Ou koulye a, lajounen kon lannwit, nan non a fis Israël yo, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:1">És 10:1</ref></char></note> konfese peche a fis Israël yo ke nou te fè kont Ou menm. Mwen menm avèk lakay papa m te peche. <verse eid="NEH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:5">Dan 9:5</ref></char></note> Nou te byen konwonpi nan zak nou te fè kont Ou yo, e nou pa t kenbe kòmandman yo, règleman yo, òdonans yo, ke ou te kòmande a sèvitè Ou a, Moïse.<verse eid="NEH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8"/>“Sonje pawòl ke Ou te kòmande sèvitè Ou a, Moïse, lè Ou te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref></char></note> ‘Si nou pa fidèl, Mwen va gaye nou pami pèp yo; <verse eid="NEH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:2">Det 30:2</ref></char></note>men si nou retounen kote Mwen, kenbe kòmandman Mwen yo, e fè yo, malgre sila nan nou ki te gaye nan zòn pi izole nan syèl yo, Mwen va ranmase yo soti la, pou mennen yo rive nan plas kote Mwen te chwazi pou non Mwen te abite a.’<verse eid="NEH 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:11">Egz 32:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Yo se sèvitè Ou e pèp Ou ke Ou te rachte pa gran pouvwa Ou, ak men pwisan Ou. <verse eid="NEH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11"/>O Senyè, mwen sipliye W, pou zòrèy ou kapab atantif a lapriyè a sèvitè Ou a ak lapriyè a sèvitè Ou yo ki pran plezi nan louwe non Ou. Fè sèvitè Ou a reyisi nan jou sila a, e bay li mizerikòd devan nonm sila a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Alò, se te mwen ki te pote tas pou wa a.<verse eid="NEH 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1"/>Li te vin rive nan mwa Nisan an, nan ventyèm ane a Wa Artaxerxès la, ke te gen diven devan li e mwen te monte pote diven an e te bay li a wa a. Alò, mwen pa t janm konn tris nan prezans li konsa. <verse eid="NEH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2"/>Konsa, wa a te di mwen: “Poukisa figi ou tris konsa, malgre ou pa malad? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:13">Pwov 15:13</ref></char></note> Sa pa mwens ke tristès kè.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Konsa, mwen te krent anpil. <verse eid="NEH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3"/>Mwen te di a wa a: “Kite wa a viv jis pou tout tan. Poukisa figi mwen pa ta dwe tris <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:3">Né 1:3</ref></char></note> lè vil la, plas a tonm papa zansèt mwen yo, dezole nèt e pòtay li yo fin brile ak dife?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4"/>Wa a te reponn mwen: “Kisa ou ta mande?” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:4">Né 1:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Konsa, mwen te priye a Bondye syèl la. <verse eid="NEH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5"/>Mwen te di wa a: “Si li ta fè wa plezi, e si sèvitè ou a te jwenn favè devan ou, voye m Juda, nan vil tonm a papa zansèt mwen yo, pou m ta kab rebati li.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 13:6">Né 13:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Epi wa a te di mwen pandan rèn nan te chita akote l: “Konbyen de tan vwayaj ou kapab ye? Epi kilè ou va retounen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:6">Konsa, sa te fè wa a plezi pou voye mwen, e mwen te bay li yon lè jis. <verse eid="NEH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7"/>Anplis mwen te di wa a: “Si sa fè wa a plezi, kite lèt bay a mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:21">Esd 7:21</ref></char></note> pou gouvènè nan pwovens yo lòtbò rivyè a, pou yo kapab kite mwen pase ladann yo jiskaske mwen rive Juda; <verse eid="NEH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8"/>anplis, yon lèt a Asaph, gadyen nan forè a wa a, pou li kapab ban mwen bwa chapant pou fè travès pou pòtay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:2">Né 7:2</ref></char></note> fò ki akote tanp lan; epi pou miray lavil la e pou kay nan sila mwen prale a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:8">Wa a te ban m tout sa akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:6">Esd 7:6</ref></char></note>bon men Bondye mwen an te sou mwen. <verse eid="NEH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9"/>Mwen te rive kote gouvènè nan pwovens lòtbò rivyè yo, e te bay yo lèt a wa a. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:22">Esd 8:22</ref></char></note> wa a te voye mwen avèk chèf lame yo ak chevalye yo. <verse eid="NEH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:19">Né 2:19</ref></char></note> Sanballat, Owonit lan avèk Tobija, chèf Amonit lan te tande koze sila a, sa te fè yo pa kontan anpil, pou yon moun ta vin chache fè byen pou fis a Israël yo.<verse eid="NEH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11"/>Konsa, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:32">Egz 8:32</ref></char></note> vini Jérusalem, e mwen te la pandan twa jou. <verse eid="NEH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12"/>Mwen te leve pandan lannwit lan, avèk kèk bon mesye avèk mwen. Mwen pa t pale pèsòn sa ke Bondye mwen an te mete nan tèt mwen pou fè pou Jérusalem nan, e pa t gen bèt avè m sof ke sila ke mwen menm te monte a. <verse eid="NEH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13"/>Konsa, mwen te sòti deyò nan nwit lan akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:13">Né 3:13</ref></char></note> Pòtay Vale a, vè Pwi Dragon an, anplis pou rive nan Pòtay Fimye a, e mwen t ap pase fè enspeksyon miray Jérusalem yo, ki te kraze nèt ak pòtay li yo ki te manje pa dife. <verse eid="NEH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14"/>Mwen te pase rive pi lwen nan Pòtay Sous Bwote a, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">II Wa 20:20</ref></char></note> Dlo Etan a Wa a; men pa t gen kote pou bèt mwen an pase. <verse eid="NEH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15"/>Konsa, mwen te pase pandan nwit lan pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:1">Jn 18:1</ref></char></note> ravin nan pou te fè enspeksyon miray la. Epi mwen te antre ankò nan Pòtay Vale a e mwen te retounen. <verse eid="NEH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16"/>Chèf lokal yo pa t konnen kote mwen te ale a, ni sa mwen te fè a; ni jis rive nan moman sa a, mwen potko pale Jwif yo, prèt yo, moun nòb yo, chèf yo, ni lòt moun ki t ap fè travay yo.<verse eid="NEH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17"/>Konsa mwen te di yo: “Nou wè move ka nou an, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:3">Né 1:3</ref></char></note> Jérusalem dezole e pòtay li yo fin brile pa dife? Vini, annou rebati miray Jérusalem nan pou nou pa parèt kon yon wont ankò.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18"/>Mwen te pale yo jan men Bondye mwen an te ban m favè e anplis, pawòl ke wa a te pale mwen yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Yo te di: “Annou leve pou bati.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 2:7">II Sam 2:7</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te mete men yo nan bon èv sila a.<verse eid="NEH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19"/>Men lè Sanballat, Owonit lan avèk Tobija, chèf Amonit lan, avèk Guéschem, Arab la, te tande koze sa a, yo te moke nou, te meprize nou, epi te di: “Ki bagay sa n ap fè la a? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 6:6">Né 6:6</ref></char></note> Èske nou ap fè rebèl kont wa a?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20"/>Konsa, mwen te reponn yo epi te di yo: “Bondye syèl la va fè nou reyisi. Se akoz sa a, sèvitè li yo va leve pou bati. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:3">Esd 4:3</ref></char></note> Men nou menm, nou p ap gen pòsyon, ni dwa, ni souvni nan Jérusalem.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1"/>Epi Éliaschib, wo prèt la, te leve avèk frè li yo, prèt yo pou te bati Pòtay Mouton an. Yo te konsakre li e te kwoke pòt li yo. Yo te konsakre miray depi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:39">Né 12:39</ref></char></note> tou Méa yo jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:38">Jr 31:38</ref> </char></note>tou Hananeel la. <verse eid="NEH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2"/>Akote li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:36">Né 7:36</ref></char></note> mesye Jéricho yo te bati, e akote li, Zaccur, fis a Imri a te bati.<verse eid="NEH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3"/>Alò, fis a Senna yo te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:39">Né 12:39</ref></char></note> Pòtay Pwason an. Yo te poze travès li yo, e te kwoke pòt li yo avèk boulon ak ba fè. <verse eid="NEH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4"/>Akote yo, Merémoth, fis a Urie a, fis a Hakkots la, te fè reparasyon yo. Epi akote li, Meschullam, fis a Bérékia a, fis a Meschézabeel la, te fè reparasyon yo. Akote li, Tsadok, fis a Baana a, te fè reparasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5"/>Anplis, akote li, Tekoyit yo te fè reparasyon yo, men chèf prensipal pa yo a pa t bay soutyen a mèt ouvriye yo.<verse eid="NEH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6"/>Jojada, fis a Paséach la avèk Meschullam, fis a Besodia a te repare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:39">Né 12:39</ref></char></note> Pòtay ansyen an. Yo te poze travès li yo, e te kwoke pòt li yo avèk boulon ak ba fè. <verse eid="NEH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7"/>Akote yo, Melatia, Gabonit lan, e Jadon, Mewonotit la, avèk mesye Gabaon avèk Mitspa, osi te fè reparasyon yo kon reprezantan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:7">Né 2:7</ref></char></note>gouvènè pwovens lòtbò rivyè a. <verse eid="NEH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8"/>Akote li, Uzziel, fis a Harhaja a, òfèv la, te fè reparasyon yo. Epi akote li, Hanania, youn nan sila ki fè pafen yo, te fè reparasyon yo, e yo te restore Jérusalem jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:38">Né 12:38</ref></char></note> Gran Miray la. <verse eid="NEH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9"/>Akote yo, Rephaja, fis a Hur la, chèf a mwatye nan distrik Jérusalem nan, te fè reparasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10"/>Akote yo, Jedaja, fis a Harumaph la, te fè reparasyon anfas lakay li a. Epi akote li, Hattusch, fis a Haschabnia a, te fè reparasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11"/>Malkija, fis a Harim nan avèk Haschub, fis a Pachath-Moab la, te fè yon lòt pati, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:38">Né 12:38</ref></char></note> Wo Tou Founo yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12"/>Akote li, Schallum, fis a Hallochesch la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:9">Né 3:9</ref></char></note> chèf a mwatye nan distrik Jérusalem nan te fè reparasyon yo ansanm avèk fi li yo.<verse eid="NEH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13"/>Hanun avèk moun ki te rete Zanoach yo te repare <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:13">Né 2:13</ref></char></note> Pòtay Vale a. Yo te bati li e te kwoke pòt li yo avèk boulon ak ba fè e te fè mil koude nan miray la vè Pòtay Fimye a.<verse eid="NEH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14"/>Malkija, fis a Récab la, chèf <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:1">Jr 6:1</ref></char></note>Beth-Hakkérem nan, te repare Pòtay Fimye a. Li te bati li, e te kwoke pòt li yo avèk boulon ak ba fè.<verse eid="NEH 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15"/>Schallun, fis a Col-Hozé a, chèf nan distrik Mitspa a, te repare Pòtay Sous Bwote a. Li te bati li, te kouvri li, te kwoke pòt li yo avèk boulon ak ba fè, avèk miray kote Etan Siloé a toupre<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:4">II Wa 25:4</ref></char></note> jaden a wa a jis rive kote mach pye eskalye ki te desann soti lavil David la. <verse eid="NEH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16"/>Apre li menm, Néhémie, fis a Azbuk la, chèf a mwatye distri Beth-Tsur a te fè reparasyon yo jis rive anfas tonm a David yo, rive jis nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">II Wa 20:20</ref></char></note>etan fèt a lamen avèk kay a mesye vanyan yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17"/>Apre li, Levit yo te kontinye reparasyon yo anba Rehum, fis a Bani a. Akote li menm, Haschabia, chèf a mwatye distrik Keïla a, te fè reparasyon yo pou distri pa li a. <verse eid="NEH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18"/>Apre li, frè pa yo te fè reparasyon yo anba Bavvaï, fis a Hénadad la, chèf a lòt mwatye distri a Keïla a. <verse eid="NEH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19"/>Akote li Ézer, fis a Josué a, chèf a Mitspa a, te repare yon lòt pòsyon devan pant asnal la, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:9">II Kwo 26:9</ref> </char></note> ang lan. <verse eid="NEH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20"/>Apre li Baruc, fis a Zabbaï a te repare avèk gwo kouraj, yon lòt pòsyon soti nan ang lan jis rive devan pòt a Éliaschib la, wo prèt la. <verse eid="NEH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21"/>Apre li menm, Merémoth, fis a Urie a, fis a Hakkots la, te repare yon lòt pòsyon soti nan pòtay lakay Éliaschib la, jis rive nan dènye pwent lakay Éliaschib la. <verse eid="NEH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22"/>Apre li, prèt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:28">Né 12:28</ref></char></note>mesye a vale yo te reyisi fè reparasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23"/>Apre yo menm, Benjamin avèk Haschub te fè reparasyon yo devan lakay pa yo. Apre yo, Azaria, fis a Maaséja a, fis a Anania a, te fè reparasyon yo devan lakay pa li. <verse eid="NEH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24"/>Apre li Binnuï, fis a Hénadad la, te repare yon lòt pòsyon soti lakay Azaria, jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:19">Né 3:19</ref></char></note> ang lan, jis rive nan kwen an. <verse eid="NEH 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25"/>Palal, fis a Uzaï a te fè reparasyon yo devan ang lan avèk fò ki te parèt soti anwo kote lakay wa a, ki akote lakou gad la. Apre li, Pedaja, fis a Pareosch la, te fè reparasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26"/>Sèvitè tanp ki te rete nan landwa Fimye yo te fè reparasyon yo jis pa devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:21">Né 11:21</ref></char></note>Pòtay Dlo a vè lès avèk fò pwolonje a. <verse eid="NEH 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27"/>Apre yo menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:5">Né 3:5</ref></char></note> Tekoyit yo te repare yon lòt pati pa devan wo fò pwolonje a jis rive nan miray Fimye a.<verse eid="NEH 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28"/>Piwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 23:15">II Kwo 23:15</ref></char></note>Pòtay Cheval la, prèt yo te reyisi fè reparasyon pa yo, yo chak devan pwòp kay pa yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29"/>Apre yo menm, Tsadok, fis Immer a, te fè reparasyon yo devan lakay li. Epi apre li, Schemaeja, fis a Schecania a, gadyen Pòtay lès la te fè reparasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30"/>Apre li, Hanania, fis a Schélémia a e Hanun, sizyèm fis a Tsalaph la, te repare yon lòt pati. Apre li, Meschullam, fis Békékia te travay anfas pwòp chanm li. <verse eid="NEH 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31"/>Apre li menm, Malkija, youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:8-22">Né 3:8-22</ref></char></note> òfèv yo, te fè reparasyon yo jis rive nan kay sèvitè tanp yo ak machann yo devan Pòtay Enspeksyon an, e jis rive nan wo chanm kwen an. <verse eid="NEH 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32"/>Antre wo chanm nan kwen an ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:1">Né 3:1</ref></char></note> Pòtay Mouton yo, òfèv yo avèk machann yo te fè reparasyon yo.<verse eid="NEH 3:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:10">Né 2:10</ref></char></note>Sanballat te tande ke nou t ap rebati miray la, li te vin anraje nèt, byen fache e te moke Jwif yo. <verse eid="NEH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2"/>Li te pale nan prezans a frè li yo avèk Samariten rich yo. Li te di: “Se kisa Jwif san kapasite ak fòs sa yo ap fè la a? Èske y ap restore li pou kont yo? Èske yo kab ofri sakrifis? Èske yo kab fin fè l nan yon jounen? Èske yo kab restore wòch yo soti nan ranblè plen pousyè a; menm sa ki te brile yo?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3"/>Alò, Tobija, Amonit lan, te toupre li. Li te di: “Menm sa y ap bati, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 5:18">Lam 5:18</ref></char></note> si yon rena ta vòltije ladann, li ta kraze wòch miray yo!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4"/>Tande, O Bondye pa nou an, kijan nou meprize! Fè repwòch pa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 79:12">Sòm 79:12</ref></char></note> retounen sou pwòp tèt yo, e livre yo pou yo ta vin piyaje nan yon peyi an kaptivite. <verse eid="NEH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5"/>Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:27">Sòm 69:27</ref></char></note>padone inikite yo, e pa kite peche yo efase devan Ou, paske yo te dekouraje ouvriye ki t ap bati yo.<verse eid="NEH 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6"/>Konsa, nou te bati miray la, e tout miray la te jwenn ansanm jis rive nan mwatye wotè li, paske pèp la te gen tèt ansanm pou travay la.<verse eid="NEH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7"/>Alò, lè Sanballat, Tobija, Arab yo, Amonit ak Ashdodit yo te tande ke reparasyon miray Jérusalem yo te kontinye, e ke brèch yo te kòmanse fèmen yo te byen fache. <verse eid="NEH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8"/>Yo tout ansanm te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:3">Sòm 83:3</ref></char></note> fè konplo pou vin goumen kont Jérusalem, e pou fè zen ladann. <verse eid="NEH 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9"/>Men nou te priye a Bondye nou an e akoz yo menm, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:11">Né 4:11</ref></char></note> plase yon gad pou anpeche yo lajounen kon lannwit. <verse eid="NEH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10"/>Konsa, nan Juda yo t ap di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">“Fòs a sila ki pote chaj yo ap febli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">Malgre, toujou gen anpil fatra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">Epi nou menm pou kont nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 4:10">P ap kab rebati miray la.”<verse eid="NEH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11"/>Lènmi nou yo t ap di: “Yo p ap konnen ni wè jiskaske nou vini pami yo, touye yo e mete fen nan travay la.”<verse eid="NEH 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12"/>Lè Jwif ki te rete toupre yo te vin kote nou dis fwa epi te di nou: “Yo va vini kont nou soti tout kote ke nou kab vire,”<verse eid="NEH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13"/>Alò, mwen te estasyone moun nan pati piba nan espas dèyè miray la, kote ki te manke pwotèj e mwen te estasyone moun pami fanmi yo avèk nepe pa yo, lans ak banza yo. <verse eid="NEH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14"/>Lè m te wè ke yo te pè, mwen te leve pale avèk gwo moun yo, chèf yo ak tout lòt moun yo: “Pa pè yo; sonje Senyè a gran e mèvèye. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 10:12">II Sam 10:12</ref></char></note>Goumen pou frè nou yo, fis nou yo, fi nou yo, madanm nou yo ak lakay nou yo.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15"/>Lè lènmi nou yo te tande ke afè yo te rekonèt pa nou, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:14">II Sam 17:14</ref></char></note>Bondye te jennen plan yo; alò, nou tout te retounen kote miray la, chak moun nan pwòp travay li. <verse eid="NEH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16"/>Depi jou sa a, mwatye nan sèvitè mwen yo te fè travay la, e lòt mwatye a te kenbe lans yo, boukliye pwotèj yo, banza yo ak pwotèj lestomak yo. Epi kapitèn yo te dèyè lakay Juda a. <verse eid="NEH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17"/>Sila ki t ap rebati miray la avèk sila ki te pote chaj yo te pran chaj yo nan yon men pou fè travay la e te kenbe yon zam nan lòt men an. <verse eid="NEH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18"/>Epi pou sila ki t ap bati yo, chak moun te mete yon nepe senti nan ren li pandan li t ap bati a, e mesye twonpèt la te rete toupre mwen. <verse eid="NEH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19"/>Mwen te pale ak gwo moun yo, chèf yo, ak tout lòt moun yo: “Travay la gran e vast e nou se separe sou miray la de yon lwen a yon lòt. <verse eid="NEH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20"/>Nenpòt kote ke nou tande twonpèt la, vin rive kote nou la a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:14">Egz 14:14</ref></char></note>Bondye nou an va goumen pou nou.”<verse eid="NEH 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21"/>Konsa, nou te kontinye travay la avèk mwatye nan yo ki te kenbe lans yo soti nan maten jis rive lè zetwal yo te vin parèt. <verse eid="NEH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22"/>Nan lè sa a, mwen te di pèp la ankò: “Kite chak mesye yo ansanm avèk sèvitè li pase nwit lan Jérusalem pou yo kab fè yon bon gad pou nou pandan nwit lan, e sèvi kon yon ouvriye nan lajounen.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23"/>Konsa, ni mwen menm, ni frè m yo, sèvitè mwen yo, ni mesye nan gad ki te swiv mwen yo, okenn pa t rete rad yo, chak moun te pote zam li, menm lè yo ale chache dlo.<verse eid="NEH 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1"/>Alò, te gen yon gwo kriye a moun sa yo avèk madanm pa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:35">Lev 25:35</ref></char></note> kont frè Jwif parèy yo. <verse eid="NEH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2"/>Paske te gen nan yo ki te di: “Nou menm, fis nou yo avèk fi nou yo anpil; pou sa, kite nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:6">Ag 1:6</ref></char></note>jwenn sereyal pou nou kab manje e viv.” <verse eid="NEH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3"/>Te gen lòt ki te di: “Nou ap prete kòb kont chan nou yo, chan rezen yo, avèk kay nou yo pou nou kab twouve sereyal pou nou manje akoz gwo grangou a.” <verse eid="NEH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4"/>Anplis, te gen ki te di: “Nou te prete lajan kont chan nou avèk chan rezen nou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:13">Esd 4:13</ref></char></note> pou peye taks a wa a sou chan avèk chan rezen yo. <verse eid="NEH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5"/>Alò, chè nou se menm ak chè a frè nou yo, pitit pa nou yo kon pa yo. Sepandan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39">Lev 25:39</ref></char></note> nou ap fòse fè fis nou yo avèk fi nou yo vin esklav, gen nan yo ki deja mare ladann e nou san sekou, akoz chan nou avèk chan rezen nou yo vin pou yon lòt moun.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6"/>Epi mwen te byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 11:8">Egz 11:8</ref></char></note> fache lè mwen te tande kriye ak pawòl sila yo. <verse eid="NEH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7"/>Mwen te konsilte avèk tèt mwen, e mwen te kanpe fèm ak gwo chèf yo, avèk gwo moun yo epi te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:36">Lev 25:36</ref></char></note>“Nou ap egzije enterè, soti nan men frè nou yo!” Akoz sa, mwen te reyini yon gran asanble kont yo. <verse eid="NEH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8"/>Mwen te di yo: “Nou menm, selon kapasite nou, te rachte Jwif frè parèy nou yo ki te vann a lòt nasyon yo; alò koulye a, èske nou ta menm vann frè nou yo pou yo ta kab vin vann a nou menm?” Yo te rete an silans e pa t kab twouve yon pawòl pou pale. <verse eid="NEH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9"/>Ankò, mwen te di: “Bagay ke n ap fè a pa bon! Èske nou pa ta dwe mache nan lakrent Bondye nou an pou evite repwòch a lòt nasyon yo, lènmi nou yo? <verse eid="NEH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10"/>Epi anplis, mwen menm ak frè mwen yo ap prete yo lajan avèk sereyal. Souple, sispann mande enterè sa a. <verse eid="NEH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11"/>Souple, remèt yo nan menm jou sa a, chan yo, chan rezen yo, chan oliv yo, avèk kay yo, avèk santyèm pati nan lajan, nan sereyal, diven nèf, avèk lwil ke nou ap egzije de yo.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12"/>Epi yo te di: “Nou va remèt li e nou p ap mande yo anyen. N ap fè ojis tout sa ke ou di yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Konsa, mwen te rele prèt yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:5">Esd 10:5</ref></char></note> pran yon sèman soti nan yo pou yo ta fè selon sa ke yo te pwomèt yo. <verse eid="NEH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:6">Trav 18:6</ref></char></note> Anplis, mwen te souke pati devan vètman mwen epi te di; “Se konsa ke Bondye ta souke retire sou chak moun oswa se lakay li, oswa byen pa li, sila ki pa akonpli pwomès sa a; menm konsa pou l ta souke vide.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Epi tout asanble a te di: “Amen!” Epi yo te fè lwanj a SENYÈ a. Konsa, pèp la te fè selon sa yo te pwomèt yo.<verse eid="NEH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14"/>Anplis, soti nan jou sa a mwen te chwazi kon gouvènè sou yo nan peyi Juda, soti nan ventyèm ane a jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:5">Né 13:5</ref></char></note> trann-dezyèm ane a Wa Artexarxès la, pandan douzan, ni mwen ni moun fanmi parèy a mwen, yo pa t manje nan pati nan manje prevwa pou gouvènè a. <verse eid="NEH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:9">Né 5:9</ref></char></note> Men gouvènè ki te avan mwen yo te konn mete chaj sou pèp la e te pran soti nan men yo pen avèk diven plis karant sik ajan; menm sèvitè pa yo te konn vin kon chèf sou moun. Men mwen pa t fè sa akoz lakrent Bondye. <verse eid="NEH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16"/>Anplis, mwen te aplike mwen a travay sou miray la. Nou pa t achte okenn teren e sèvitè pa m yo te toujou rasanble la pou travay la. <verse eid="NEH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17"/>Toujou te gen sou tab mwen san-senkant Jwif avèk chèf yo, anplis, sila ki te vin kote nou soti nan nasyon ki te antoure nou yo. <verse eid="NEH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:22-23">I Wa 4:22-23</ref></char></note> sa ki te prepare chak jou yo se te yon gwo bèf avèk sis mouton nan meyè kalite, zwazo ki te prepare pou mwen; epi yon fwa chak di jou, tout kalite diven an abondans. Men pou tout sa, mwen pa t mande nan taks prevwa pou gouvènè a, akoz chaj la te lou sou pèp sa a. <verse eid="NEH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:14-23">Né 13:14-23</ref></char></note> Sonje mwen, O Bondye mwen avèk bonte Ou, pou tout sa ke m te fè pou pèp sa a.<verse eid="NEH 5:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1"/>Alò, lè l te rapòte a Sanballat, Tobija, Guéschem, Arab la, avèk lòt lènmi nou yo, ke mwen te rebati miray la e ke pa t gen brèch ankò ladann; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:1-3">Né 3:1-3</ref></char></note> malgre nan moman sa a, nou potko monte pòt nan pòtay yo, <verse eid="NEH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2"/>Sanballat avèk Guéschem te voye kote mwen epi te di: “Vini, annou reyini ansanm nan Chephirim nan plèn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 8:12">I Kwo 8:12</ref></char></note> Ono.” Men se mal ke yo te gen entansyon pou fè m.<verse eid="NEH 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3"/>Konsa, mwen te voye mesaje yo kote yo. Mwen te di: “Mwen ap fè yon gwo travay, e mwen p ap kab desann. Poukisa travay la ta dwe rete pandan mwen kite li pou vin kote nou?”<verse eid="NEH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4"/>Yo te voye kote mwen kat fwa konsa e mwen te reponn yo menm jan an. <verse eid="NEH 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5"/>Konsa, Sanballat te voye sèvitè li kote mwen yon senkyèm fwa avèk yon lèt ouvri nan men l. <verse eid="NEH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6"/>Ladann, li te ekri: “Gen yon rapò k ap fèt pami nasyon yo, e Gaschmu ap di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:19">Né 2:19</ref></char></note> ou menm avèk Jwif yo gen plan pou fè rebelyon. Ke se pou sa ke w ap rebati miray la. Epi se ou menm ki va wa yo, selon rapò yo. <verse eid="NEH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7"/>Anplis ke ou te chwazi pwofèt Jérusalem yo pou fè pwoklamasyon pou ou menm, pou ‘Yon wa nan Juda!’ Konsa, yon rapò va voye kote wa a sou rapò sila yo. Pou sa a, vin kounye a, pou nou fè konsèy ansanm.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8"/>Konsa, mwen te voye kote li. Mwen te di: “Kalite bagay sa yo ke w ap pale yo, pa t janm fèt, men w ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:4">Job 13:4</ref></char></note> envante yo nan pwòp panse ou.” <verse eid="NEH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9"/>Paske, yo tout t ap eseye fè nou pè e t ap reflechi: “Yo va vin dekouraje avèk travay la, e li p ap fèt.” Men koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 138:3">Sòm 138:3</ref></char></note> O Bondye ranfòse men m.<verse eid="NEH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10"/>Lè m te antre lakay Schemaeja, fis a Delaja a, fis a Mehétabeel la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:5">Jr 36:5</ref></char></note> ki pa t kab kite lakay li, li te di: “Annou reyini ansanm lakay Bondye a, anndan tanp lan, annou fèmen pòt tanp yo, paske yo ap vin touye ou. Wi, y ap vini pandan lannwit la pou touye ou.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11"/>Men mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:1">Pwov 28:1</ref></char></note> “Èske yon nonm tankou mwen ta dwe sove ale kache? Epi èske yon moun tankou mwen ta antre nan tanp lan pou sove lavi li? Mwen p ap antre.” <verse eid="NEH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12"/>Konsa, mwen te vin apèsi ke anverite, Bondye pa t voye li, men li te eksprime pwofesi a kont mwen akoz Tobija avèk Sanballat te anplwaye li. <verse eid="NEH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13"/>Li te anplwaye li pou rezon sa a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 6:6">Né 6:6</ref></char></note> pou m ta kapab vin pè pou aji konsa e peche, pou yo menm ta kab gen yon move rapò kon repwòch kont mwen. <verse eid="NEH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:29">Né 13:29</ref></char></note> Sonje, O Bondye mwen, Tobija avèk Sanballat selon zèv pa yo, e anplis, pwofetès la, Noadia, ak lòt pwofèt ki te eseye fè m pè yo.<verse eid="NEH 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 4:1-2">Né 4:1-2</ref></char></note> miray la te fini nan venn-senkyèm jou mwa Elul la, sou senkant-de jou. <verse eid="NEH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16"/>Lè tout lènmi nou yo te tande e tout nasyon ki antoure nou yo, te wè, yo te pèdi kouraj, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:25">Egz 14:25</ref></char></note> yo te rekonèt ke travay sa a te fèt avèk èd Bondye pa nou an. <verse eid="NEH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17"/>Anplis, nan jou sa yo, anpil lèt te sòti nan gwo moun a Juda yo bay Tobija e lèt Tobija yo te rive kote yo. <verse eid="NEH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18"/>Paske anpil nan yo te mare pa sèman ak li menm, paske li te bofis a Schecania, fis a Arach la e fis pa li a, Jochanan te marye ak fi a Meschullam nan, fis a Bérékia a. <verse eid="NEH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19"/>Anplis, yo t ap pale afè bon zèv li nan prezans mwen e te bay li rapò a pawòl mwen yo.<verse eid="NEH 6:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 6:1-15">Né 6:1-15</ref></char></note> miray la te fin rebati, mwen te fin monte pòt yo e gadyen pòtay yo avèk chantè yo avèk Levit yo te chwazi. <verse eid="NEH 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2"/>Anplis, mwen te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:2">Né 1:2</ref></char></note> Hanani, frè mwen an, avèk Hanania, kòmandan fò a, an chaj Jérusalem. Paske li te yon nonm fidèl e te gen lakrent Bondye plis pase anpil moun. <verse eid="NEH 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3"/>Mwen te di yo: “Pa kite pòtay Jérusalem yo ouvri jiskaske solèy la vin cho ak pandan gad yo an plas yo, fè yo fèmen pòt yo e boulonnen yo. Anplis, chwazi gad yo soti nan pèp Jérusalem nan, chak moun sou pòs li e chak moun devan pwòp kay pa li.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4"/>Alò, vil la te byen gran avèk anpil espas, men moun ladann yo pa t anpil e kay yo potko bati.<verse eid="NEH 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Pwov 2:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Konsa, Bondye mwen an te mete sa nan kè m pou rasanble sitwayen enpòtan lavil yo, chèf yo avèk pèp la pou vin anrejistre pa lign zansèt yo. Mwen te twouve liv a zansèt a sila ki te monte an premye yo, e ladann, rekò swivan an:<verse eid="NEH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 2:1-70">Esd 2:1-70</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sila yo se pèp pwovens ki te monte soti an kaptivite nan egzil ke Nebucadnetsar, wa Babylone nan, te pote ale yo, e ki te retounen Jérusalem avèk Juda, chak moun nan lavil pa li; <verse eid="NEH 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7"/>moun ki te vini avèk Zorobabel yo, Josué, Néhémie, Azaria, Raamia, Nachamani, Mardochée, Bilschan, Mispéreth, Bigvaï, Nehum, Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Kantite mesye nan pèp Israël yo:<verse eid="NEH 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8"/>Fis a Pareosch yo, de-mil-san-swasann-douz.<verse eid="NEH 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9"/>Fis a Schephathia yo, twa-san-senkant-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10"/>Fis a Arach yo, sis-san-senkant-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11"/>Fis a Pachath-Moab yo, fis a Josué yo avèk Joab, de-mil-ui-san-dizwit.<verse eid="NEH 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12"/>Fis a Élam yo, mil-de-san-senkant-kat.<verse eid="NEH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13"/>Fis a Zatthu yo, ui-san-karann-senk.<verse eid="NEH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14"/>Fis a Zaccaï yo, sèt-san-swasant.<verse eid="NEH 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15"/>Fis a Binnuï yo, sis-san-karann-tuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16"/>Fis a Bébaï yo, sis-san-venn-tuit<verse eid="NEH 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17"/>Fis a Azgad yo, de-mil-twa-san-venn-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18"/>Fis a Adonikam yo, sis-san-swasann-sèt.<verse eid="NEH 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19"/>Fis a Bigvaï yo, de-mil-swasann-sèt.<verse eid="NEH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20"/>Fis a Adin yo, Sis-san-senkann-senk.<verse eid="NEH 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21"/>Fis a Ather yo, nan fanmi Ézéchias, katra-ven-di-zuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22"/>Fis a Haschum yo, twa-san-venn-tuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23"/>Fis a Betsaï yo, twa-san-venn-tuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24"/>Fis a Hariph yo, san-douz.<verse eid="NEH 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25"/>Fis a Gabaon yo, katre-ven-kenz.<verse eid="NEH 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26"/>Mesye a Bethléem yo avèk Netopha, san-katre-ven-uit.<verse eid="NEH 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27"/>Mesye a Anathoth yo, san-venn-tuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28"/>Mesye a Beth-Azmaveth yo, karann-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29"/>Mesye a Kirjath-Jearim yo, a Kephira, avèk Beéroth, sèt-san-karann-twa.<verse eid="NEH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30"/>Mesye a Rama yo avèk Guéba, sis-san-ven-te-yen.<verse eid="NEH 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31"/>Mesye nan Micmas yo, san-venn-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32"/>Mesye nan Béthel avèk Aï yo, san-venn-twa.<verse eid="NEH 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33"/>Mesye nan lòt Nebo yo, san-karann-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34"/>Fis a lòt Élam yo, mil-de-san-senkann-kat.<verse eid="NEH 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35"/>Fis a Harim yo, twa-san-ven.<verse eid="NEH 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36"/>Fis a Jéricho yo, twa-san-karann-senk.<verse eid="NEH 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37"/>Fis a Lod, Hadid avèk Ono yo, sèt-san-ven-te-yen.<verse eid="NEH 7:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38"/>Fis a Senaa yo, twa-mil-nèf-san-trant.<verse eid="NEH 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39"/>Prèt yo: fis a Jedaeja lakay Josué yo, nèf-san-swasann-trèz.<verse eid="NEH 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40"/>Fis a Immer yo, mil-senkann-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41"/>Fis a Paschhur yo, mil-de-san-karann-sèt.<verse eid="NEH 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42"/>Fis a Harim yo, mil-di-sèt.<verse eid="NEH 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43"/>Levit yo: fis a Josué ak Kadmiel yo, avèk fis a Hodeva yo, swasann-katòz.<verse eid="NEH 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44"/>Chantè yo: fis a Asaph yo, san-karann-tuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45"/>Gadyen pòtay yo: fis a Schallum yo, fis a Ather yo, fis a Thaimon yo, fis a Akkub yo, fis a Hathitha yo, fis a Schobaï yo, san-trann-tuit.<verse eid="NEH 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46"/>Sèvitè tanp yo: fis a Tsicha yo, fis a Hasupha yo, fis a Thabbaoth yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47"/>Fis a Kéros yo, fis a Sia yo, fis a Padon yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48"/>Fis a Lebana yo, fis a Hagaba yo, fis a Salmaï yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49"/>Fis a Hanan yo, fis a Guiddel yo, fis a Gachar yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50"/>Fis a Reaja yo, fis a Retsin yo, fis a Nekoda yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51"/>Fis a Gazzam yo, fis a Uzza yo, fis a Paséach yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52"/>Fis a Bésaï yo, fis a Mehunim yo, fis a Nephischsim yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53"/>Fis a Bakbuk yo, fis a Hakupha yo, fis a Harhur yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54"/>Fis a Batslith yo, fis a Mehida yo, fis a Harscha yo, <verse eid="NEH 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55"/>fis a Barkos yo, fis a Sisera yo, fis a Thamach yo, <verse eid="NEH 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56"/>fis a Netsiach yo, fis a Hathipha yo.<verse eid="NEH 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57"/>Fis a sèvitè Salomon yo: fis a Sothaï yo, fis a Sophéreth yo, fis a Perida yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58"/>Fis a Jaaia yo, fis a Darkon yo, fis a Guiddel yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59"/>Fis a Schephathia yo, fis a Hatthil yo, fis a Pokéreth-Hatsebaïm yo, fis a Amon yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60"/>Tout sèvitè tanp yo avèk fis a sèvitè Salomon yo, twa-san-katre-ven-douz.<verse eid="NEH 7:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61"/>Sila yo se te yo menm ki te monte soti Tel-Melah yo, Tel-Harsha, Cherub, Addon e Immer yo, men yo pa t kab bay prèv lakay papa zansèt pa yo, pou demontre ke se Izrayelit yo te ye:<verse eid="NEH 7:61"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62"/>fis a Delaiah yo, fis a Tobiah yo, fis a Nekoda yo, sis-san-karann-de.<verse eid="NEH 7:62"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63"/>Nan prèt yo: fis a Hobaja yo, fis a Hakkots yo, fis a Barzillaï yo, ki te pran kon madanm youn nan fis a Barzillaï yo, Galaadit la e te rele selon non pa yo.<verse eid="NEH 7:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64"/>Sila yo te fè rechèch nan achiv zansèt yo, men yo pa t kapab twouve yo; akoz sa, yo te konsidere pa pwòp e pa t kab fè sèvis kon prèt. <verse eid="NEH 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65"/>Gouvènè a te pale yo ke yo pa t pou manje soti nan bagay sen pase tout lòt bagay yo, jiskaske yon prèt vin leve avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Egz 28:30</ref></char></note> Ourim avèk Thoumim nan.<verse eid="NEH 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66"/>Asanble a an antye te karann-de-mil-twa-san-swasant moun, <verse eid="NEH 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67"/>anplis, sèvitè avèk sèvant pa yo, sou sila yo te gen sèt-mil-twa-san-trann-sèt moun; epi yo te gen de-san-karann-senk gason avèk fanm nan chantè yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:68 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:66">Esd 2:66</ref></char></note> Cheval pa yo te sèt-san-trann-sis; milèt yo, de-san-karann-senk; <verse eid="NEH 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69"/>chamo yo, kat-san-trann-senk, bourik yo, si-mil-sèt-san-ven.<verse eid="NEH 7:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70"/>Kèk moun pami tèt lakay zansèt yo te fè don pou travay la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:70 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:65">Né 7:65</ref></char></note>Gouvènè a te bay nan trezò a travay la mil ons an lò, senkant basen ak senk-san-trant nan vètman prèt yo. <verse eid="NEH 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71"/>Kèk moun pami tèt lakay zansèt yo te bay nan trezò travay la ven-mil ons an lò ak de-mil-de-san min an ajan. <verse eid="NEH 7:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72"/>Sa ki te bay pa tout lòt moun nan pèp la te ven-mil ons an lò, ak de-mil min an ajan, avèk swasann-sèt nan vètman prèt.<verse eid="NEH 7:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:73 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:2">I Kwo 9:2</ref></char></note> prèt yo, Levit yo, gadyen pòtay yo, chantè yo, kèk moun nan pèp la, sèvitè tanp yo ak tout Israël te rete nan vil pa yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Lè setyèm mwa a te vin rive, fis Israël yo te vin antre nan pwòp vil pa yo.<verse eid="NEH 7:73"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1"/>Konsa, tout pèp la te rasanble kon yon sèl moun nan plas ki te devan Pòtay Dlo a. E yo te pale ak Esdras, skrib la, pou mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:15">II Kwo 34:15</ref></char></note> liv lalwa Moïse la ke SENYÈ a te bay a Israël la. <verse eid="NEH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2"/>Epi Esdras, prèt la, te pote lalwa a devan asanble a mesye yo avèk fanm yo, tout moun te kab koute avèk bon konprann, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lev 23:24</ref></char></note> nan premye jou nan setyèm mwa a. <verse eid="NEH 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:1">Né 8:1</ref></char></note> Li te li nan liv la devan plas ki te devan Pòtay Dlo a soti granmaten jis rive midi, nan prezans a mesye ak fanm ki te atantif a liv lalwa a. <verse eid="NEH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4"/>Esdras, skrib la, te kanpe devan yon etaj an bwa ki te fèt eksprè pou afè sila a. Akote li te kanpe Matthithia, Schéma, Anaja, Urie, Hilkija, avèk Maaséja adwat li e agoch li, Pedaja, Mischaël, Malkija, Haschum, Haschbaddana, Zacharie ak Meschullam. <verse eid="NEH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5"/>Esdras te ouvri liv la devan zye tout pèp la, paske li te kanpe pi wo ke tout pèp la. Lè li te ouvri li, tout pèp la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:20">Jij 3:20</ref></char></note> te kanpe. <verse eid="NEH 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6"/>Epi Esdras te beni SENYÈ a, gran Bondye a.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 8:6">Tout pèp la te reponn: “Amen, Amen,” pandan yo te leve men yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:31">Egz 4:31</ref> </char></note> Yo te bese ba pou te adore SENYÈ a avèk figi yo jis atè. <verse eid="NEH 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7"/>Anplis, Josué, Bani, Schérébia, Jamin, Akkub, Schabbethaï, Hodija, Maaséja, Kelitha, Azaria, Jozabad, Hanan, Pelaja, avèk Levit yo te eksplike lalwa a pèp la pandan pèp la te rete an plas. <verse eid="NEH 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8"/>Yo te li nan liv la, soti nan lalwa Bondye a, e te tradwi pou fè yo konprann, pou yo ta kab byen sezi sa ki te li a.<verse eid="NEH 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9"/>Néhémie, ki te gouvènè a ak Esdras, prèt la ak skrib, avèk Levit ki te enstwi pèp la, te di a tout pèp la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:2">Né 8:2</ref></char></note> “Jou sa a sen a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:7-12">Det 12:7-12</ref></char></note>Pa fè dèy, ni pa kriye.” Paske, tout pèp la t ap kriye lè yo te tande pawòl lalwa yo. <verse eid="NEH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10"/>Konsa, li te di yo: “Ale manje grès, bwè sa ki dous e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 26:11-13">Det 26:11-13</ref></char></note> voye bay pòsyon a sila ki pa t prepare yo; paske jou sa a sen a SENYÈ nou an. Pa fè lapèn ak soufrans, paske lajwa SENYÈ a se fòs nou.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11"/>Konsa, Levit yo te kalme tout pèp la, epi te di: “Rete kalm, paske jou a sen. Pa fè doulè.”<verse eid="NEH 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12"/>Tout pèp la te Soti pou manje, bwè e voye bay pòsyon pou selebre yon gwo fèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:7-8">Né 8:7-8</ref></char></note> akoz yo te konprann pawòl ke yo te fenk tande.<verse eid="NEH 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13"/>Nan dezyèm jou fèt la, tout chèf zansèt a tout pèp la, prèt yo ak Levit yo te rasanble kote Esdras, skrib la, pou yo ta kab ranmase konesans nan pawòl lalwa yo. <verse eid="NEH 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14"/>Yo te twouve ekri nan lalwa a jan SENYÈ a te kòmande pa Moïse ke fis Israël yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34-42">Lev 23:34-42</ref></char></note> ta dwe viv nan tonèl pandan fèt setyèm mwa a. <verse eid="NEH 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15"/>Konsa, yo te fè pwoklamasyon an, e te pwoklame li nan tout vil pa yo ak Jérusalem. Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:40">Lev 23:40</ref></char></note> “Ale deyò vè ti mòn yo e pote branch oliv yo, avèk branch oliv mawon yo, branch bwa bazilik yo, branch palmis yo, avèk branch nan lòt kalite bwa ak fèy, pou fè tonèl yo, jan sa ekri a.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16"/>Pou sa, pèp la te sòti e te pote yo pou fè tonèl yo pou yo menm, chak nan twati pla anwo kay pa yo, oswa nan lakou yo, nan lakou lakay Bondye a, nan plas kote Pòtay Dlo a, e nan plas kote Pòtay Ephraïm nan. <verse eid="NEH 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17"/>Tout asanble a sila ki te retounen soti an kaptivite yo te fè tonèl yo, e te rete ladann yo. Fis Israël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:8">II Kwo 7:8</ref></char></note> anverite, pa t konn fè sa depi nan jou a Josué yo, fis a Nun nan, jis rive nan jou sa a. Epi te gen gwo rejwisans. <verse eid="NEH 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:11">Det 31:11</ref></char></note> Li te li soti nan liv lalwa a chak jou, soti nan premye jou a, jis rive nan dènye jou a. Yo te selebre fèt la pandan sèt jou, e nan uityèm jou a, te gen yon asanble solanèl selon òdonans lan.<verse eid="NEH 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1"/>Alò, nan venn-katriyèm jou nan mwa sa a, fis Israël yo te rasanble <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 8:23">Esd 8:23</ref></char></note> fè jèn abiye ak twal sak ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:12">I Sam 4:12</ref></char></note>tè yo mete sou yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2"/>Desandan Israël yo te separe yo soti nan tout etranje yo, e te kanpe pou konfese peche pa yo avèk inikite a papa zansèt yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3"/>Pandan yo te kanpe nan plas yo, yo te li soti nan liv lalwa SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, pou yon ka de jounen an. Pou yon lòt ka, yo te konfese e te adore SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a. <verse eid="NEH 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:7">Né 8:7</ref></char></note> Alò, sou etaj, Levit yo te kanpe Jousé, Bani, Dadmiel, Schebania, Bunni, Schérébia, Bani avèk Kenani. Yo t ap kriye ak vwa fò anlè a SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a.<verse eid="NEH 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5"/>Konsa, Levit yo, Josué, Kadmiel, Bani, Haschabnia, Schérébia, Hodija, Schebania, avèk Pethachja te di: “Leve pou beni SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, jis pou tout tan! O ke non Ou ki se leve wo sou tout benediksyon yo ak lwanj yo ranpli ak glwa kapab beni. <verse eid="NEH 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6"/>Se Ou sèl ki SENYÈ a. Ou te fè syèl yo, syèl de syèl yo avèk tout lame pa yo, latè a avèk tout sa ki sou li, lanmè ak tout sa ki ladann. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref></char></note> Se Ou ki bay yo tout lavi. Menm lame syèl la bese ba devan Ou. <verse eid="NEH 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Jen 11:31</ref></char></note>Ou se SENYÈ a, ki te chwazi Abram nan, e ki te fè l sòti nan Ur a Kaldeyen yo, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Jen 17:5</ref></char></note>bay li non Abraham. <verse eid="NEH 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8"/>Ou te twouve kè li fidèl devan Ou, epi te fè yon akò avèk li, pou bay li tout tè a Canaan yo, a Etyen yo avèk Amoreyen yo, a Ferezyen yo, Jebizyen yo, avèk Girezyen yo, pou livre bay li a desandan pa li yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:43-45">Jos 21:43-45</ref></char></note> Konsa, Ou te akonpli pwomès Ou te fè a, paske Ou jis. <verse eid="NEH 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9"/>Ou te wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Egz 3:7</ref></char></note>afliksyon a zansèt nou yo an Egypte, epi te tande kri yo akote Lanmè Wouj. <verse eid="NEH 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10"/>Ou te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-25">Egz 7:8-25</ref></char></note> sign ak mèvèy kont Farawon, kont tout sèvitè li yo avèk moun a peyi li yo, paske Ou te konnen ke yo te aji avèk awogans kont yo, epi te fè yon non pou tèt Ou ki dire jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="NEH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Egz 14:21</ref></char></note> Ou te divize lanmè a devan yo. Konsa yo te pase nan mitan lanmè a sou tè sèch. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:1-10">Egz 15:1-10</ref></char></note>sila ki te kouri dèyè yo te jete nan fon, tankou yon wòch nan dlo anraje. <verse eid="NEH 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12"/>Avèk yon pilye nwaj, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Egz 13:21-22</ref></char></note>Ou te mennen pèp la pandan lajounen, e avèk yon pilye dife pandan lannwit, pou limen chemen yo sou sila yo ta dwe mache yo.<verse eid="NEH 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13"/>Anplis, Ou te desann sou Mon Sinaï, e te pale avèk yo soti nan syèl la. Ou te bay yo òdonans ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:7-9">Sòm 19:7-9</ref></char></note>jis avèk lalwa ki te vrè, bon règleman avèk bon kòmandman yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14"/>Konsa, Ou te fè yo rekonèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:23">Egz 16:23</ref></char></note> Saba sen Ou an, epi te byen poze pou yo, kòmandman yo, règleman yo, avèk lalwa yo pa sèvitè Ou, Moïse. <verse eid="NEH 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15"/>Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:15">Egz 16:15</ref></char></note> te founi pen soti nan syèl la pou grangou yo, epi Ou te mennen dlo soti nan yon wòch pou yo menm, pou swaf yo, epi Ou te di yo antre ladann nan peyi ke Ou te sèmante pou bay yo pou posede a. <verse eid="NEH 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16"/>Men yo menm, zansèt nou yo, te aji avèk awogans. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:26-33">Det 1:26-33</ref></char></note> Yo te fè tèt di, epi te refize koute kòmandman Ou yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:4">Nonb 14:4</ref></char></note> refize koute e yo pa t sonje mèvèy ke Ou te fè pami yo. Konsa, yo te vin tèt di, e te chwazi yon chèf ki pou mennen yo retounen an esklavaj yo an Egypte. Men Ou se yon Bondye ki padone, plen ak gras avèk mizerikòd, lan nan kòlè e plen avèk lanmou dous. Ou pa t abandone yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18"/>Menm lè yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4-31">Egz 32:4-31</ref></char></note> fè pou kont yo yon ti bèf an metal fonn, yo te di: ‘Sa se Bondye nou, ki te mennen nou monte soti an Egypte la’, epi te fè gran blasfèm, <verse eid="NEH 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:2-4">Det 8:2-4</ref></char></note> Ou menm, nan gran mizerikòd Ou, pa t abandone yo nan dezè. Pilye nwaj la pa t kite yo pandan lajounen, pou gide yo nan chemen yo, ni pilye dife a pandan lannwit, pou klere pou yo chemen an, e montre yo direksyon ke yo dwe ale. <verse eid="NEH 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:17">Nonb 11:17</ref></char></note> Ou te bay bon lespri pa Ou pou enstwi yo. Lamàn Ou, Ou pa t refize fè antre nan bouch yo. Ou te bay yo dlo pou lè yo te swaf. <verse eid="NEH 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21"/>Anverite, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:7">Det 2:7</ref></char></note> karantan, Ou te fè pwovizyon pou yo nan dezè a, e yo pa t manke anyen. Rad yo pa t epwize, ni pye yo pa t anfle. <verse eid="NEH 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22"/>Anplis, Ou te bay yo wayòm yo avèk pèp yo, epi te divize bay yo tout selon pòsyon pa yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nonb 21:21-35</ref></char></note>Yo te pran posesyon a peyi Sihon, wa a Hesbon an ak peyi Og, wa Basan an. <verse eid="NEH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23"/>Ou te fè fis pa yo vin anpil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Jen 15:5</ref></char></note> kon zetwal syèl yo, epi Ou te mennen yo antre nan peyi ke Ou te mande zansèt pa yo antre pou posede a. <verse eid="NEH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Jos 11:23</ref></char></note> Pou sa, fis pa yo te antre pou posede peyi a. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Jos 18:1</ref></char></note>Ou te fè moun peyi a Canaan yo soumèt devan Ou. Konsa, Ou te livre yo nan men yo, avèk wa yo ak pèp peyi a, pou fè avèk yo sa yo te pito. <verse eid="NEH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25"/>Yo te kaptire vil fòtifye yo, avèk tèren byen fètil yo. Yo te vin posede <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:11">Det 6:11</ref></char></note> kay yo plen avèk tout bon bagay, sitèn ki fin fouye, chan rezen, chan oliv avèk pye fwi an kantite. Konsa, yo te manje, te vin plen, epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:15">Det 32:15</ref></char></note>vin gra, e te pran plezi nan gran bonte Ou. <verse eid="NEH 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11">Jij 2:11</ref></char></note> Men yo te tanmen dezobeyi, epi te fè rebèl kont Ou. Yo te jete lalwa pa Ou dèyè do yo, e te touye pwofèt Ou yo ki te bay yo avètisman pou yo ta retounen kote Ou, epi yo te komèt gwo blasfèm. <verse eid="NEH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:14">Jij 2:14</ref></char></note> Ou te livre yo nan men a opresè yo ki te oprime yo. Men lè yo te kriye a Ou menm nan tan gwo twoub yo, Ou te tande soti nan syèl la, epi pa gran lanmou dous Ou, Ou te bay yo chèf liberatè yo, ki te delivre yo nan men a opresè yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:11">Jij 3:11</ref></char></note> soti lè yo te fin jwenn repo a, yo te fè mal ankò devan Ou. Pou sa, Ou te abandone yo nan men a lènmi yo, jiskaske yo te renye sou yo. Lè yo te kriye ankò a Ou menm, Ou te tande Soti nan syèl la, epi anpil fwa Ou te fè yo chape akoz gran lanmou dous Ou, <verse eid="NEH 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29"/>epi te fè tèmwen kont yo pou fè yo retounen kote lalwa Ou. Sepandan, yo te aji avèk awogans e pa t Koute kòmandman Ou yo, men te peche kont òdonans Ou yo, selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char></note>sila yo, si yon nonm ta swiv yo, li ta viv. Men yo te vire yon do byen di, yo te fè tèt di, epi te refize koute. <verse eid="NEH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30"/>Malgre sa, Ou te sipòte yo pandan anpil ane, epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15-16">II Kwo 36:15-16</ref></char></note> avèti yo pa Lespri Ou, pa pwofèt Ou yo. Sepandan, yo te refize bay zòrèy yo. Akoz sa, Ou te livre yo nan men a pèp nasyon yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31"/>Men nan gran mizerikòd Ou, Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:27">Jr 4:27</ref></char></note>pa t fini ak yo, ni abandone yo, paske Ou menm se yon Bondye gras avèk mizerikòd. <verse eid="NEH 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32"/>Alò, pou sa, Bondye Nou an, Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:5">Né 1:5</ref></char></note>gran, pwisan e mèvèy la, ki kenbe akò li avèk Lanmou dous, pa kite tout twoub sa yo vin bliye devan Ou, ki te vin rive sou nou, wa nou yo, chèf nou yo, prèt nou yo, papa zansèt nou yo, ak sou tout pèp Ou yo, depi nan jou wa Assyrie yo, jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="NEH 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33"/>Sepandan, Ou jis nan tout sa ki vin rive nou; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:25">Jen 18:25</ref></char></note>Ou te aji avèk fidelite, men nou te aji mal. <verse eid="NEH 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34"/>Paske wa nou yo, chèf nou yo, prèt nou yo ak zansèt nou yo pa t kenbe lalwa Ou yo, ni okipe kòmandman Ou yo avèk avètisman Ou yo avèk sila Ou te avèti yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35"/>Men yo, malgre nan pwòp wayòm pa yo ke Ou te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:47">Det 28:47</ref></char></note>yo, pa t sèvi Ou, ni kite zak mechan yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:48">Det 28:48</ref></char></note>nou vin esklav yo jodi a, epi pou teren ke Ou te bay a zansèt Nou yo, pou manje fwi avèk bonte li, Gade byen, nou vin esklav ladann yo. <verse eid="NEH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:33">Det 28:33</ref></char></note> Gran rekòlt li bay vin pou wa yo ke Ou te fin mete sou nou akoz peche nou yo. Anplis, yo renye sou kò nou epi sou bèt nou yo, jan yo pito; pou sa a, nou nan gran pwoblèm. <verse eid="NEH 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38"/>Alò, akoz tout sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:29">Né 10:29</ref></char></note> nou ap fè yon akò ki si, ki ekri; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:1">Né 10:1</ref> </char></note>dokiman an sele, pa Chèf nou yo, Levit nou yo ak prèt nou yo.”<verse eid="NEH 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1"/>Alò, sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:38">Né 10:38</ref></char></note>dokiman sele a te gen non a: Néhémie, gouvènè a, fis a Hacalia a ak Sédécias, <verse eid="NEH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2"/>Seraja, Azaria, Jérémie, <verse eid="NEH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3"/>Paschhur, Amaria, Malkija, <verse eid="NEH 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4"/>Hattusch, Schebania, Mallue, <verse eid="NEH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5"/>Harim, Merémoth, Abdias, <verse eid="NEH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6"/>Daniel, Guinnethon, Baruc, <verse eid="NEH 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7"/>Meschullam, Abija, Mijamin, <verse eid="NEH 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8"/>Maazia, Bilgaï, Schemaeja. Sila yo se te prèt yo. <verse eid="NEH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9"/>Epi Levit yo: Josué, fis a Azania a, Binnuï, nan fis a Hénadad yo, Kadmiel, <verse eid="NEH 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10"/>anplis frè pa yo, Schebania, Hodija, Kelitha, Pelaja, Hanan, <verse eid="NEH 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11"/>Michée, Rehob, Haschabia, <verse eid="NEH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12"/>Zaccur, Schérébia, Schebania, <verse eid="NEH 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13"/>Hodija, Bani, Beninu. <verse eid="NEH 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14"/>Chèf a pèp yo: Pareosch, Pachath-Moab, Élam, Zatthu, Bani, <verse eid="NEH 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15"/>Bunni, Azgad, Bébaï, <verse eid="NEH 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16"/>Adonija, Bigvaï, Adin, <verse eid="NEH 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17"/>Ather, Ézéchias, Azzur, <verse eid="NEH 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18"/>Hodija, Haschum, Betsaï <verse eid="NEH 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19"/>Hariph, Anathoth, Nébaï, <verse eid="NEH 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20"/>Magpiash, Meschullam, Hézir, <verse eid="NEH 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21"/>Meschézabeel, Tsadok, Jaddua, <verse eid="NEH 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22"/>Pelathia, Hanan, Anaja, <verse eid="NEH 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23"/>Hosée, Hanania, Haschub, <verse eid="NEH 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24"/>Hallochesch, Pilcha, Schobek, <verse eid="NEH 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25"/>Rehum, Haschabna, Maaséja, <verse eid="NEH 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26"/>Achija, Hanan, Anan, <verse eid="NEH 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27"/>Malluc, Harim, Baana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28"/>Alò, tout lòt moun nan pèp la, prèt yo, Levit yo, gadyen pòtay yo, chantè yo, sèvitè tanp yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:2">Né 9:2</ref></char></note>tout sila ki te separe yo menm soti nan pèp peyi yo pou lalwa Bondye pa yo, madanm pa yo, fis yo ak fi yo, tout sila ki te gen konesans avèk bon konprann yo, <verse eid="NEH 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29"/>t ap reyini ansanm avèk moun fanmi yo, chèf pa yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:12">Né 5:12</ref></char></note> t ap pran sou yo menm, sou nivo madichon, yon sèman, pou mache nan lalwa Bondye, ki te bay pa Moïse la, Sèvitè Bondye a, e pou kenbe ak obeyi tout kòmandman a Bondye yo, SENYÈ nou an, avèk òdonans Li yo avèk règleman Li yo; <verse eid="NEH 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Egz 34:16</ref></char></note>pou nou pa bay fi nou yo a pèp peyi la, ni pran fi pa yo pou fis nou yo. <verse eid="NEH 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31"/>Epi selon pèp peyi la ki konn vini avèk machandiz avèk manje pou vann nan Saba a, nou p ap achte nan men yo nan Saba a ni nan okenn jou sen. Anplis, nou va lese rekòlt yo nan setyèm ane a, ansanm avèk koleksyon a tout dèt.<verse eid="NEH 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32"/>Ankò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Egz 30:11-16</ref></char></note>nou plase pwòp tèt nou anba obligasyon pou fè kontribisyon yon tyè sik chak ane pou sèvis lakay Bondye nou an: <verse eid="NEH 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33"/>pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-6">Lev 24:5-6</ref></char></note>pen konsakre, ofrann sereyal ki pa janm fini, ofrann brile ki pa janm fini, Saba yo, nouvèl lin, pou lè chwazi yo, pou bagay sen yo e pou ofrann peche pou fè ekspiyasyon pou peche Israël yo ak tout travay lakay Bondye nou an. <verse eid="NEH 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34"/>Menm jan an, nou te tire osò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:31">Né 13:31</ref></char></note> pou founi depo bwa pou prèt yo, Levit yo ak pèp la pou yo ta kab mennen li lakay Bondye a, selon lakay zansèt papa nou yo, nan lè ki te etabli nan ane a, pou brile sou lotèl SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, jan sa ekri nan lalwa a; <verse eid="NEH 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35"/>epi pou yo ta kab pote premye fwi tè yo avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Egz 23:19</ref></char></note>premye fwi a tout fwi a tout pyebwa yo, lakay SENYÈ a chak ane, <verse eid="NEH 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Egz 13:2</ref></char></note>pote lakay Bondye nou an, premye ne a fis nou yo ak bèf nou yo e premye ne nan bann mouton avèk twoupo nou yo, jan sa ekri nan lalwa a, pou prèt ki ap sèvi lakay Bondye nou an. <verse eid="NEH 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:17">Lev 23:17</ref></char></note>E ke nou va, osi, pote premye nan pat farin nou yo, kontribisyon nou yo, fwi a tout pyebwa, diven nèf avèk lwil pou prèt yo nan chanm lakay Bondye nou an ak dim <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nonb 18:21</ref></char></note>tè nou pou Levit yo; paske se Levit yo ki resevwa dim nan tout vil andeyò yo. <verse eid="NEH 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:26">Nonb 18:26</ref></char></note>Prèt la, fis a Aaron an, va avèk Levit yo lè Levit yo resevwa dim yo, e Levit yo va pote yon dizyèm nan dim pa yo vè lakay Bondye nou an, pou l antre nan chanm depo yo. <verse eid="NEH 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39"/>Paske, fis Israël yo avèk fis Lévi yo va pote don sereyal la, diven nèf la ak lwil la nan chanm yo. La se zouti a sanktiyè yo, prèt k ap fè sèvis yo, gadyen pòtay yo, ak chantè yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:10-11">Né 13:10-11</ref></char></note>nou p ap neglije lakay Bondye nou an.<verse eid="NEH 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:4">Né 7:4</ref></char></note> chèf a pèp yo te rete Jérusalem, men rès pèp la te tire osò pou fè youn nan dis Izrayelit andeyò yo vin rete Jérusalem, nan vil sen an, pandan nèf sou dis te rete nan lòt vil yo. <verse eid="NEH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2"/>Pèp la te beni tout mesye ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:9">Jij 5:9</ref></char></note> pa volonte yo, vin rete Jérusalem yo.<verse eid="NEH 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 9:2-34">I Kwo 9:2-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Alò, sila yo se chèf an tèt pwovens ki te vin rete Jérusalem yo; men nan vil a Juda yo, chak moun te rete sou pwòp teren pa l nan vil pa yo—Izrayelit yo, prèt yo, Levit yo, sèvitè tanp yo ak desandan a sèvitè Salomon yo. <verse eid="NEH 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4"/>Kèk nan fis a Juda yo avèk kèk nan fis a Benjamin yo te rete Jérusalem. Soti nan fis Juda yo: Athaja, fis a Ozias la, fis a Zacharie, fis Amaria, fis Schephathia, fis a Mahalaleel, fis a Pérets yo; <verse eid="NEH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5"/>epi Maaséja, fis a Barue, fis a Col-Hozé, fis a Hazaja, fis a Adaja a, fis a Jojarib, fis a Zacharie, fis a Schiloni. <verse eid="NEH 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6"/>Total fis a Pérets ki te etabli Jérusalem yo te kat-san-swasann-tuit mesye de gran kouraj.<verse eid="NEH 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7"/>Men fis a Benjamin yo: Sallu, fis a Meschullam nan, fis a Joëd la, fis a Pedaja, fis a Kolaja a, fis a Maaséja a, fis a Ithiel la, fis a Ésaïe a. <verse eid="NEH 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8"/>Epi apre li, Gabbaaï avèk Sallaï, nèf-san-venn-tuit. <verse eid="NEH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9"/>Joël, fis a Zicri a, te chèf yo; epi Juda, fis a Senua a, se te douzyèm chèf lavil la.<verse eid="NEH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10"/>Soti nan prèt yo: Jedaeja, fis a Jojarib la, Jakin, <verse eid="NEH 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11"/>Seraja, fis a Hilkija a, fis a Meschullam nan, fis a Tsadok la, fis a Merajoth la, fis a Achithub la, ki te dirije lakay Bondye, <verse eid="NEH 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12"/>epi fanmi yo ki te fè travay tanp lan, ui-san-venn-de; epi Adaja, fis a Jerocham nan, fis a Pelalia a, fis a Amtsi a, fis a Zacharie a, fis a Paschhur la, fis a Malkija a, <verse eid="NEH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13"/>epi fanmi yo, chèf lakay papa zansèt yo, de-san-karann-de; epi Amaschasaï, fis a Azareel la, fis a Achazaï a, fis a Meschillémoth la, fis a Immer a, <verse eid="NEH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14"/>avèk frè pa yo, mesye ki plen kouraj, san-venn-tuit. Zabdiel, fis a Guedolim nan, se te chèf yo.<verse eid="NEH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15"/>Alò, soti nan Levit yo: Schemaeja, fis a Haschub la, fis a Azrikam nan, fis a Haschabia a, fis a Bunni an; <verse eid="NEH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16"/>Schabbethaï avèk Jozabad soti nan dirijan Levit yo, ki te sipèvize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:29">I Kwo 26:29</ref></char></note> travay deyò nan lakou lakay Bondye a; <verse eid="NEH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17"/>epi Matthania, fis a Michée a, fis a Zabdi a, fis Asaph ki te responsab ouvri avèk remèsiman a Bondye nan lapriyè a, Bakbukia, dezyèm pami frè li yo e Abda, fis a Schammua a, fis a Galal la, fis a Jeduthun nan. <verse eid="NEH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18"/>Tout Levit yo nèt nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:1">Né 11:1</ref></char></note>lavil sen an se te de-san-katre-ven-kat.<verse eid="NEH 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19"/>Anplis, gadyen pòtay yo, Akkub, Thalmon, avèk frè parèy yo ki te okipe pòtay yo te san-swasann-douz. <verse eid="NEH 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20"/>Tout lòt Israël, pami prèt yo ak Levit yo te nan lòt vil Juda yo, yo chak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:3">Né 11:3</ref></char></note>sou pwòp eritaj pa yo. <verse eid="NEH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:26">Né 3:26</ref></char></note> sèvitè tanp yo te rete nan ti mòn Ophel la, e Tsicha avèk Guischpa te chèf a sèvitè tanp yo.<verse eid="NEH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 11:9-24">Né 11:9-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Chèf Levit Jérusalem yo te Uzzi, fis a Bani an, fis a Haschabia a, fis a Matthania a, fis a Michée a, pami fis Asaph, ki te chantè pou sèvis lakay Bondye a. <verse eid="NEH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:8">Esd 6:8</ref></char></note>Paske te gen lòd ki sòti nan wa a de yo menm, ak yon règ manje pou sila ki te dirije chante yo jou apre jou yo. <verse eid="NEH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24"/>Pethachja, fis a Meschézabeel la, nan fis a Zérach yo, fis a Juda a, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 18:17">I Kwo 18:17</ref></char></note>reprezante wa a nan tout bagay ki te konsène pèp la.<verse eid="NEH 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25"/>Selon vil yo avèk chan pa yo, kèk nan fis a Juda yo te rete Kirjath-Arba avèk bouk pa li yo, nan Dibon avèk landwa ki antoure li a, e Jekabtseel avèk bouk ki te antoure li yo. <verse eid="NEH 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26"/>A Jéschua, a Molada, a Beth-Paleth, <verse eid="NEH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27"/>a Hatsar-Schual, a Beer-Schéba avèk bouk pa li yo, <verse eid="NEH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28"/>ak Tsiklag, a Mecona, avèk bouk pa li yo, <verse eid="NEH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29"/>a En-Rimmon, a Tsorea, a Jarmuth, <verse eid="NEH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30"/>a Zanoach, a Adullam ak bouk li yo, Lakis avèk anviwon li, Azéka avèk bouk pa li yo. Konsa, yo te fè anplasman yo soti Beer-Schéba jis rive nan vale Hinnom an. <verse eid="NEH 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31"/>Anplis, fis a Benjamin yo te rete soti Guéba ale nèt, a Micmasch, a Ajja, a Béthel, avèk bouk pa li yo, <verse eid="NEH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32"/>a Anathoth, a Nob, a Hanania, <verse eid="NEH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33"/>a Hatsor, a Rama, a Guithaïm, <verse eid="NEH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34"/>a Hadid, a Tseboïm, a Neballath, <verse eid="NEH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35"/>a Lod avèk Ono, vale a ouvriye yo. <verse eid="NEH 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36"/>Soti nan Levit yo, kèk nan divizyon Juda yo te rete nan landwa Benjamin an.<verse eid="NEH 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1"/>Alò, sila yo se te prèt avèk Levit ki te monte avèk Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la ak Josué: Seraja, Jérémie, Esdras, <verse eid="NEH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2"/>Amaria, Malluc, Hattusch, <verse eid="NEH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3"/>Schecania, Rehum, Merémoth, <verse eid="NEH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4"/>Iddo, Guinnethoï, Abija, <verse eid="NEH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5"/>Mijamin, Maadia, Bilga, <verse eid="NEH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6"/>Schemaeja, Jojarib, Jedaeja. <verse eid="NEH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7"/>Sallu, Amok, Hilkija, Jedaeja. Sila yo te chèf prèt yo avèk fanmi pa yo nan tan Josué a.<verse eid="NEH 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8"/>Levit yo te Josué, Binnuï, Kadmiel, Schérébia, Juda, Matthania, ki, avèk frè li yo, te dirije chan remèsiman yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9"/>Anplis Bakbukia avèk Unni, frè pa yo ki te kanpe anfas yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:24">Né 12:24</ref></char></note> divizyon sèvis yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10"/>Josué te vin papa a Jojakim, Jojakim te fè Éliaschib, Éliaschib te fè Jojada, <verse eid="NEH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11"/>Jojada te fè Jonathan e Jonathan te fè Jaddua.<verse eid="NEH 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12"/>Alò, nan tan Jojakim, prèt yo, chèf an tèt lakay zansèt papa yo te pou Seraja, Meraja, e pou Jérémie, Hanania; <verse eid="NEH 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13"/>Pou Esdras, Meschullam; pou Amaria, Jochanan; <verse eid="NEH 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14"/>pou Meluki, Jonathan; pou Schebvania, Jospeh; <verse eid="NEH 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15"/>pou Harim, Adna; pou Merajoth, Helkaï; <verse eid="NEH 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16"/>pou Iddo, Zacharie; pou Guinnethon, Meschullam; <verse eid="NEH 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17"/>pou Abija, Zicri; pou Minjamin avèk Moadia, Pilthaï; <verse eid="NEH 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18"/>pou Bilga, Schammua; pou Schemaeja, Jonathan; <verse eid="NEH 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19"/>pou Jojarib, Matthnaï; pou Jedaeja, Uzzi; <verse eid="NEH 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20"/>pou Sallaï, Kallaï; pou Amok, Éber; <verse eid="NEH 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21"/>pou Hilkija, Haschabla; pou Jedaeja, Nathanaël.<verse eid="NEH 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22"/>Epi pou Levit yo, chèf an tèt lakay papa zansèt pa yo te anrejistre nan jou a Éliaschib yo, Jojada, avèk Jochanan ak Jaddua; konsa yo te sèvi kon prèt nan règn Darius, Perse la. <verse eid="NEH 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23"/>Fis a Lévi yo, chèf an tèt lakay papa zansèt yo, te anrejistre nan Liv A Kwonik yo jis rive nan tan Jochanan, fis Éliaschib la. <verse eid="NEH 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24"/>Chèf an tèt a Levit yo te Haschabia, Schérébia e Josué, fis a Kadmiel la, avèk frè pa yo anfas yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 11:17">Né 11:17</ref></char></note> pou bay lwanj avèk remèsiman, jan sa te preskri pa David, nonm Bondye a, divizyon ki te koresponn ak divizyon. <verse eid="NEH 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25"/>Matthania, Bakbukia, Abdias, Meschullam, Thalmon avèk Akkub, te gadyen pòtay ki te responsab veye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:15">I Kwo 26:15</ref></char></note> depo pòtay yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26"/>Sila yo te sèvi nan jou a Jojakim yo, fis a Josué a, fis a Jotsadak la e nan jou a Néhémie yo, gouvènè a, avèk Esdras, prèt la ak skrib.<verse eid="NEH 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27"/>Alò, nan dedikasyon miray Jérusalem nan, yo te chache twouve Levit soti nan tout plas yo pou mennen yo Jérusalem pou yo ta kab selebre dedikasyon an avèk jwa, avèk lwanj kè kontan, avèk chan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:16-28">I Kwo 15:16-28</ref> </char></note>avèk senbal, ap ak lenstriman a kòd yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28"/>Konsa, fis a chantè yo te rasanble soti nan distri ki te antoure Jérusalem nan e soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:16">I Kwo 9:16</ref></char></note>nan vilaj a Netofatyen yo, <verse eid="NEH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29"/>soti Beth-Guilgal, avèk chan nan Guéba avèk Azmavet, paske chantè yo te fin bati pou kont yo vilaj nan anviwon Jérusalem yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30"/>Prèt yo avèk Levit yo te pirifye tèt yo; anplis, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:22-30">Né 13:22-30</ref></char></note> pirifye pèp la, pòt yo avèk miray la.<verse eid="NEH 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31"/>Konsa, mwen te fè dirijan a Juda yo vin monte sou miray la, e mwen te chwazi de gran gwoup koral premye ki t ap sòti sou bò dwat anlè miray la vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:13">Né 2:13</ref></char></note> Pòtay Kolin Fimye a. <verse eid="NEH 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32"/>Hosée avèk mwatye nan dirijan Juda yo te swiv yo, <verse eid="NEH 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33"/>avèk Azaria, Esdras, Meschullam, <verse eid="NEH 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34"/>Juda, Benjamin, Schemaja, avèk Jérémie, <verse eid="NEH 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35"/>epi kèk nan fis a prèt yo avèk twonpèt yo: Zacharie, fis a Jonathan an, fis a Schemaeja a, fis a Matthania a, fis a Michée a, fis a Zaccur a, fis a Asaph la; <verse eid="NEH 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36"/>avèk fanmi li yo, Schemaeja, Azaneel, Juda ak Hanani, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:24">Né 12:24</ref></char></note>avèk enstriman mizik a David yo, nonm Bondye a. Epi Esdras, skrib la, te ale devan yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37"/>Nan Pòtay Sous Bwote a, yo te monte tou dwat sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:15">Né 3:15</ref></char></note>eskalye lavil David la toupre eskalye miray la anwo lakay David la, pou rive nan Pòtay Dlo a vè lès.<verse eid="NEH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38"/>Dezyèm koral la te ale vè goch, pandan mwen t ap swiv yo avèk mwatye pèp la sou miray la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:11">Né 3:11</ref></char></note> anwo Tou Founo yo, rive nan Gran Miray la. <verse eid="NEH 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39"/>Epi anwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 8:16">Né 8:16</ref></char></note> Pòtay Éphraïm nan, kote Pòtay ansyen an, kote Pòtay Pwason an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 3:1">Né 3:1</ref></char></note>Fò Hananeel la ak fò a dè Santèn yo, jis rive nan Pòtay Mouton yo; epi yo te rete kanpe nan Pòtay Gad la. <verse eid="NEH 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40"/>Epi de koral yo te kanpe nan pozisyon yo lakay Bondye a, e mwen menm tou, avèk mwatye ofisye ki te avè m yo; <verse eid="NEH 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41"/>epi prèt yo, Éliakim, Maaséja, Minjamin, Michée, Eljoénaï, Zacharie, Hanania, avèk twonpèt yo; <verse eid="NEH 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42"/>epi Maaséja, Schemaeja, Éléazar, Uzzi, Jochanan, Malkija, Élam ak Ézer. Epi chantè yo te chante avèk Jizrachja, dirijan pa yo a, <verse eid="NEH 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43"/>Nan jou sa a, yo te ofri gran sakrifis e te rejwi paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 9:2">Sòm 9:2</ref></char></note> Bondye te bay yo gwo lajwa. Fanm yo ak timoun yo tou te rejwi, jiskaske lajwa Jérusalem nan te tande byen lwen.<verse eid="NEH 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:4-13">Né 13:4-13</ref></char></note> nan jou sa a, mesye yo te chwazi kon responsab sou chanm depo yo, kontribisyon yo, premye fwi yo, ak dim yo, pou ranmase yo antre soti nan chan nan vil yo, pòsyon ki te mande pa lalwa a pou prèt ak Levit yo; paske Juda te rejwi de prèt avèk Levit ki te fè sèvis yo. <verse eid="NEH 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45"/>Paske, yo te ranpli devwa Bondye yo a, avèk sèvis pirifikasyon an, ansanm avèk chantè yo ak gadyen pòtay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1">I Kwo 25:1</ref></char></note>an akò avèk lòd David avèk fis li a, Salomon. <verse eid="NEH 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46"/>Paske nan jou a David avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:30">II Kwo 29:30</ref></char></note> Asaph yo, nan tan ansyen an, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:33">I Kwo 9:33</ref></char></note>dirijan pou chantè yo ak chan adorasyon yo, e kantik remèsiman a Bondye. <verse eid="NEH 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47"/>Konsa, tout Israël nan jou Zorobabel avèk Néhémie yo te bay pòsyon ki te dwe fèt pou chantè yo avèk gadyen pòtay yo kon chak jou te mande a, e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nonb 18:21</ref></char></note> mete apa pòsyon ki te konsakre a Levit yo; epi Levit yo te mete apa pòsyon ki te konsakre pou fis Aaron yo.<verse eid="NEH 12:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1"/>Nan jou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:3">Né 9:3</ref></char></note> yo te li soti nan liv Moïse la, nan tande a pèp la, epi li te twouve ekri ladann ke ni Amonit ni Moabit pa ta janm dwe antre nan asanble Bondye a, <verse eid="NEH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2"/>paske yo pa t rankontre fis Israël yo avèk pen avèk dlo, men te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:3-11">Nonb 22:3-11</ref></char></note> anplwaye Balaam kont yo pou bay yo madichon. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:5">Det 23:5</ref></char></note>Bondye nou an te vire madichon an fè l vin benediksyon. <verse eid="NEH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3"/>Pou sa, lè yo te tande lalwa a, yo te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:38">Egz 12:38</ref></char></note>tout etranje yo deyò Israël.<verse eid="NEH 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4"/>Alò, avan sa a, Éliaschib, prèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 12:44">Né 12:44</ref></char></note>ki te chwazi dirijan nan chanm lakay Bondye yo, ki te fè aliyans ak Tobija, <verse eid="NEH 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5"/>te prepare yon gran chanm pou li, nan kote a ki oparavan te konn sèvi pou depo ofrann sereyal yo, lansan a, zouti ak dim sereyal yo, diven avèk lwil ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nonb 18:21</ref></char></note>pou Levit yo, chantè yo, ak gadyen pòtay yo, avèk kontribisyon balanse an lè, ki te pou prèt yo. <verse eid="NEH 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6"/>Men pandan tout tan sa a, mwen pa t la Jérusalem, paske nan trann-dezyèm ane <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:22">Esd 6:22</ref></char></note>Artaxerxès la, wa a Babylone nan, mwen te deja ale kote wa a. Men apre kèk tan, mwen te mande pèmisyon a wa a pou m sòti, <verse eid="NEH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7"/>epi mwen te rive Jérusalem e te vin aprann mal ke Éliaschib te fè pou Tobija a, lè l <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:5">Né 13:5</ref></char></note> te prepare yon chanm pou li nan lakou lakay Bondye a. <verse eid="NEH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8"/>Sa te fè m pa kontan anpil. Konsa, mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Jn 2:13-16</ref></char></note>jete tout bagay Tobija yo deyò chanm nan. <verse eid="NEH 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9"/>Epi mwen te pase lòd, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:5-16">II Kwo 29:5-16</ref></char></note>yo te netwaye chanm yo. Mwen te remete la zouti lakay Bondye yo avèk ofrann sereyal la ak lansan an.<verse eid="NEH 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10"/>Anplis, mwen te dekouvri ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:19">Det 12:19</ref></char></note>pòsyon Levit yo pa t konn bay a yo menm ki te fè Levit yo avèk chantè yo ki te pèfòme nan fè sèvis yo, ale; yo chak nan pwòp chan pa l. <verse eid="NEH 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11"/>Konsa, mwen te repwoche responsab yo. Mwen te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:39">Né 10:39</ref></char></note>“Poukisa lakay Bondye a abandone?” Mwen te reyini yo ansanm e te fè yo reprann pòs yo. <verse eid="NEH 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12"/>Konsa ankò, tout Juda te pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:37">Né 10:37</ref></char></note> dim sereyal la, diven an avèk lwil la, antre nan kay depo yo. <verse eid="NEH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13"/>Kon responsab pou kay depo yo, mwen te chwazi Schélémia, prèt la, Tsadok, skrib la, avèk Pedaja a Levit yo: epi akote sila yo, Hanan, fis a Zaccur a, fis a Matthania a; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:2">Né 7:2</ref></char></note> yo te konsidere kon moun serye e se te tach pa yo pou separe bay a frè yo.<verse eid="NEH 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 5:19">Né 5:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Sonje mwen pou sa, O Bondye mwen, e pa efase zèv fidèl ke m te fè pou lakay Bondye mwen an ak sèvis mwen te fè pou li a.<verse eid="NEH 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15"/>Nan jou sa yo, mwen te wè nan Juda kèk moun ki t ap bat rezen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:12-14">Det 5:12-14</ref></char></note> nan Saba a, ki t ap fè antre sak sereyal yo, chaje yo sou bourik yo, ansanm avèk diven an, rezen yo, fig yo ak tout kalite chaj yo pou yo te pote yo antre Jérusalem nan jou Saba a. Pou sa, mwen te fè temwen kont yo nan jou ke yo t ap vann manje a. <verse eid="NEH 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16"/>Anplis, mesye Tyre yo te rete la e te enpòte pwason avèk tout kalite machandiz, ki te vann a fis Juda yo nan Saba a, menm nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="NEH 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17"/>Pou sa a mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:11-25">Né 13:11-25</ref></char></note>bay repwòch a moun prensipal Juda yo epi te di yo: “Ki kalite mal nou ap fè la a, lè nou vin degrade jou Saba a? <verse eid="NEH 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:13">Esd 9:13</ref></char></note> Èske papa nou yo pa t fè menm bagay la, jiskaske Bondye nou an te fè rive nou avèk tout vil sa a tout twoub sa yo? Sepandan, nou ap ogmante kòlè sou Israël lè nou vin desann jou Saba a konsa.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:32">Lev 23:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te vin rive ke lè l te fenk ap fènwa nan pòtay Jérusalem yo avan Saba a, mwen te pase lòd pou pòt yo ta fèmen e pou yo pa ta ouvri yo jiskaske Saba a te fini. Mwen te estasyone kèk nan sèvitè mwen yo nan pòtay yo pou okenn chaj pa t antre nan Saba a. <verse eid="NEH 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20"/>Youn oswa de fwa, machann a tout kalite machandiz te oblije pase nwit lan deyò Jérusalem. <verse eid="NEH 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:15">Né 13:15</ref></char></note> mwen te avèti yo, epi te di yo: “Poukisa nou pase nwit lan devan miray la? Si nou fè sa ankò, m ap sèvi ak fòs kont nou.” Depi lè sa a jis ale nèt, yo pa t vini nan Saba a. <verse eid="NEH 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22"/>Mwen te pase lòd a Levit yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:12">I Kwo 15:12</ref></char></note>ke yo ta dwe pirifye tèt yo e vini tankou gadyen pòtay yo pou sanktifye jou Saba a. Pou sa, anplis, sonje mwen, O Bondye mwen e fè mwen mizerikòd, selon grandè lanmou dous Ou.<verse eid="NEH 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23"/>Anplis, nan jou sa yo, mwen te wè ke Jwif yo te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:2">Esd 9:2</ref></char></note> marye ak fanm Ashdod yo, Ammon, avèk Moab yo. <verse eid="NEH 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24"/>Epi selon pitit yo, mwatye nan yo te pale langaj Ashdod la, e nanpwen menm nan yo ki te gen kapasite pou pale langaj Juda a, men pito langaj a pèp pa li a. <verse eid="NEH 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25"/>Pou sa, mwen te kanpe kont yo, mwen te bay yo madichon yo, te frape kèk nan yo, te rale cheve yo e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:29-30">Né 10:29-30</ref></char></note> fè yo sèmante pa Bondye: “Ou p ap bay fi ou yo a fis pa yo, ni pran nan fi pa yo pou fis nou, ni pou nou menm. <verse eid="NEH 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:1">I Wa 11:1</ref></char></note>Èske Salomon, wa Israël la, pa t peche nan bagay sa yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:13">I Wa 3:13</ref></char></note>Malgre, pami anpil nasyon yo, pa t gen wa tankou li, li te renmen pa Bondye li a, e Bondye te fè li wa sou tout Israël. Sepandan, fanm etranje yo te fè menm li menm nan fè peche. <verse eid="NEH 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27"/>Alò, èske nou tande de nou menm ke nou te komèt gran mal sila a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 10:2">Esd 10:2</ref></char></note>te aji avèk enfidelite kont Bondye nou an nan fè maryaj avèk fanm etranje yo?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28"/>Menm youn nan fis a Jojada yo, fis a Éliaschib la, wo prèt la, te bofis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:10">Né 2:10</ref></char></note>Sanballat, Owonit lan, e pou sa, mwen te chase li lwen mwen. <verse eid="NEH 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29"/>Sonje yo, O Bondye mwen, akoz yo te degrade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:13">Nonb 25:13</ref></char></note> otorite a prèt la, avèk akò otorite prèt yo avèk Levit yo.<verse eid="NEH 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 10:30">Né 10:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Konsa, mwen te pirifye soti nan tout bagay etranje yo e te chwazi devwa pou prèt yo ak Levit yo, yo chak nan pwòp tach pa yo; <verse eid="NEH 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 10:34">Né 10:34</ref></char></note> pou ofran founi bwa nan lè chwazi yo, ak pou premye fwi yo, sonje mwen, O Bondye mwen, pou sa ki bon.<verse eid="NEH 13:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13"/>
</usx>
